/ActualText (Pidgeon & Ward\(Senior Frontend Developer - Freelance\n\nI built the front-end for the MusiMap platform, which analyses music with AI and produces reports on style, genre, BPM, tempo, suggested songs, and more. The client handled the backend and APIs for analysing the music, and I worked closely with the CTO to create a performant and fast front-end experience. I built this using Next.js/React with static site generation.)
